GIVEN k IS A STRING
GIVETH A MAYBE Provision
`the provision with index key` MEANS
    CONSIDER filter (GIVEN p YIELD p's `index key` EQUALS k) `provision index`
    WHEN EMPTY THEN NOTHING
    WHEN x FOLLOWED BY xs THEN JUST x

GIVEN k IS A STRING
      h IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the index holds this key with this heading` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the provision with index key` k
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
    WHEN JUST p THEN p's `heading as printed` EQUALS h

